{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:checkedHeldRecordLimit:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/grant(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)"]},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app makes one where it starts, from the decisions it saved, gives it to its tracker, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"updates it as the user decides:"}]},{"code":["let consent = Consent([.analytics: .granted])","let tracker = Tracker(consent: consent)","\/\/ Later, from the consent prompt:","consent.grant(.advertising)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each event is gated by its type’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event.consentCategory"},{"type":"text","text":", by the decisions made before it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Granted:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" delivered as any event is, written to the tracker’s store first if it has one.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Undecided:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" held in memory, and not written to the store, until the category is decided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Granting it delivers its held events in the order they were tracked, before any event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked after the grant; denying it drops them, reported on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The hold keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at most "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"heldRecordLimit"},{"type":"text","text":" events across every category and tracker: when it is full, its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"oldest is dropped to make room, reported as it happens (merged with the overflow reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not yet read). Held events are lost if the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends first."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Denied:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" dropped, and not collected at all, so not reported.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Records a store recovered from an earlier run are gated again as the tracker starts, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent may have changed since. One whose category is now denied is dropped, reported and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forgotten by the store. One whose category is undecided is held outside the bound, still kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the store, so a full hold never drops it; if the app ends first, it is gated again on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"next launch. One the store drops for its own byte bound while held is reported by the store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and still delivered if granted in this run, as a record a delivery has already read is.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A category not given a status is undecided. Withdrawing consent is a denial: records the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker had already let through when it was granted are still delivered.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Copies share one set of decisions and one hold. A decision returns at once, from any thread:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it records the status, which ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)","isActive":true},{"text":" returns from then on, and queues the decision","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for each tracker given the consent, whose own worker releases or drops what it held. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker reports its own drops.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"Consent","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:8Trac